==English==

===Etymology===
Prefix "palaeo-" (from greek 'palaios'= "old") and "tropical" (from greek 'tropikos', referring to where the length of the day equals that of the night)

===Noun===
{{en-noun|''[[plurale tantum|always plural]]''}} [[Category:English pluralia tantum]]

# The [[tropics]] of "the old world", the tropical areas of both [[Africa]] and [[Asia]]. Used in biology (rare), pertaining to area of geographical occurrence.

